A11Y AUDIT - AgawanBase (Week 14 usability and accessibility)
Unity 6000.6.0f1   2026-11-18 15:56:45 UTC   edit mode
Canvas Game/UI: CanvasScaler ScaleWithScreenSize, reference 1920x1080, match 0.5
  -> on a 1080p phone 1 canvas px is ~1 device px, and Android's 48 dp floor is ~144 px.
Thresholds: contrast >= 4.5:1, touch target >= 144x144 canvas px, label rect height >= fontSize x 1.12.
Contrast is measured against the nearest ancestor Image with alpha >= 0.5, composited over black. That is the most favourable case for the light text this UI uses, so a ratio that fails here fails everywhere. Labels with no such Image are reported N/A rather than guessed.

